==Description==
The '''Ripped Elf''' was the first boss of [[Krampus Frosthold]] as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. It was quite slow but had a high amount of health. It was also immune to being frozen by freezing towers and being slowed down by the [[Toxic Gunner]]. The [[Electroshocker]] and [[Warden]] and could only slow it down. It had one ability, ''Snowball Fight'', where it tossed a massive snowball at a tower, which stunned it and other towers near it.

==Appearance==
The '''Ripped Elf''' was a large enemy with a waist, lower legs, and arms on its rig. It had a tan skin color. It also had a red buttoned up shirt with thin white stripes which had its sleeves torn off. It also had dark grey pants with thin white stripes, along with black shoes. On its waist was a belt with a golden buckle. It wore red boxing gloves with white cuffs, as well as a white armband on its right arm. There was also a tattoo on its left arm, which was a red heart with an arrow going through it, with the words "SANTA" written on it in white. This could also be seen on the back of the shirt. It had a brown beard and long ears on its head.

==Strategy==
*High DPS towers, like the [[Golden Minigunner]], [[Minigunner]] or [[Accelerator]] are recommended against this.
**The [[Pursuit]] and [[Ranger]] can be especially useful, as they are immune to being stunned.
**The [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] can be used to boost the firerate and range of these towers respectively.
*It is possible to place down cheap towers, like the [[Pyromancer]] or [[Commander]] to distract the '''Ripped Elf''' from hitting important towers.
**The '''Ripped Elf''' can target cliff towers like [[Mortar]] and [[Ranger]], but cannot stun them. These towers can also be used to prevent the '''Ripped Elf''' from attacking other important towers.
*Try placing your towers apart from each other as the ''Snowball Fight'' ability can stun multiple towers at once if they are grouped up.

